1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,933
Rosa! Mia! Anybody!

2
00:00:02,433 --> 00:00:07,800
My own voice bounces off the empty
wall. Too loud. Too small. And it
costs me air I don't have.

3
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:14,600
Rule one. Shout once. Then knock three
times and listen. Never keep shouting
at an empty place.

4
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:22,000
In my hand there's a yellow slip of
paper. It was on the floor by the
corkboard. I stuff it into my pocket
without reading it.
